            <h2>1. Developing a Bulletproof Nutrition Plan</h2>
            <p>Physical wellness is firmly rooted in your daily diet. Contrary to popular belief, a diet is not about starvation or restriction; it merely organizes your caloric intake so your body functions optimally. Beginners should focus on the 80/20 rule: 80% whole, unprocessed foods like vegetables, lean proteins, and complex carbohydrates, and 20% flexibility to enjoy life without guilt.</p>

